{"id":"xaos","name":"XaoS","tagline":"Fast real-time fractal zoomer","blurb":"Zoom and pan around a fractal in real time.","description":"Zoom and pan around a fractal in\nreal time. It can display the animated fractals.\nIt displays the Mandelbrot set or many other fractals and\nallows you to zoom smoothly into the fractal. Various coloring\nmodes are provided for both the points inside and outside the\nselected set. In addition, switching between Mandelbrot and Julia\nfractal types is provided.\nOther features include autopilot mode, palette changing,\nimage saving, fractal inversion, filters, and a built in fractal\ntutorial.","developer":"XaoS Contributors","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/icons/128x128/io.github.xaos_project.XaoS.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-1_1248x684@1.png","w":1920,"h":1053},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-2_1248x684@1.png","w":1920,"h":1053},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-3_1248x684@1.png","w":1920,"h":1053},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/xaos_project.XaoS/df188b03d58f0ad4616b6b411cee8233/screenshots/image-4_1248x684@1.png","w":1920,"h":1053}],"categories":["Education","Engineerin